## Wiring Diagram

The LEGO Education SPIKE Prime Hub uses the following ports:

```text
                 LEGO SPIKE PRIME HUB

              ┌──────────────────────┐
 Color Sensor │ A                  F │ Tilt Motor
              │                      │
   Scan Motor │ B                  E │ Not Used
              │                      │
Distance Sensor│ C                 D │ Turn Motor
              └──────────────────────┘

Port A → Color Sensor
Port B → Scan Motor
Port C → Distance Sensor
Port D → Turn Motor
Port E → Not Used
Port F → Tilt Motor
